    "body": "I see. I'm not a fan of this config, because the resulting prompt will only ever display the character and package modules (no language modules, no timing information, no sysinfo, etc) which is not a good default IMO.\r\n\r\nI'd personally much prefer to have an empty settings key, or one where most options are commented out (I don't know if commenting is possible for these configs).",
