    "body": "Indeed, that's a typo. And using the description in the HM manual for the settings entry.\r\n\r\n```nix\r\n{\r\n  # Configuration written to ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n  settings = {\r\n    # add_newline = false;\r\n\r\n    # character = {\r\n    #   success_symbol = \"[➜](bold green)\";\r\n    #   error_symbol = \"[➜](bold red)\";\r\n    # };\r\n\r\n    # package.disabled = true;\r\n  };\r\n}\r\n```",
